<title>UK: Halifax tender gets 750.6p per share.</title>
<headline>Halifax tender gets 750.6p per share.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly-floated Halifax Plc said on Tuesday that it received an average price of 750.6 per share when it sold 7.7 million shares in a tender for members on Monday.</p>
<p>The Halifax has organised a number of tenders since its flotation last Monday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
